<view class="personality-page">
  <view class="page-banner">
    <text class="banner-emoji">🎨</text>
    <text class="banner-title">趣味人格测试</text>
    <text class="banner-sub">通过轻松有趣的方式探索自己</text>
  </view>
  <view class="disclaimer-box">
    <van-icon name="info-o" size="14px" color="#999" />
    <text>本测试仅供娱乐与自我探索参考，不用于心理健康判断。测评结果不代表任何专业心理学结论。</text>
  </view>
  <view class="test-list">
    <view class="test-card" wx:for="{{tests}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="onTestTap" data-id="{{item.id}}">
      <view class="test-icon" style="background-color:{{item.color}}20;">{{item.icon}}</view>
      <view class="test-info">
        <text class="test-title">{{item.title}}</text>
        <text class="test-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
        <view class="test-meta">
          <text>{{item.questions}}题</text>
          <text>·</text>
          <text>约{{item.duration}}分钟</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <van-icon name="arrow" size="16px" color="#ccc" />
    </view>
  </view>
</view>